    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. I'm also looking at how secularization is affecting these structures. Do you think the decline in religious participation is overall a threat to the stability of modern society, or are there other ways communities are successfully replacing that sense of social order now?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
